      <Desc>FOR OVER 30 YEARS THE FOUNDATION HAS TRANSFORMED SMILES AND CHANGED LIVES FOR THOSE WHO NEED IT MOST IN SAN DIEGO. THROUGH EDUCATION, OUTREACH, AND FUNDING KEY INITIATIVES, THE FOUNDATION IS COMMITTED TO CREATING LASTING IMPACT ON THE DENTAL HEALTH AND OVERALL WELL-BEING OF OUR NEIGHBORS IN NEED. IN 2024, $7500 IN SCHOLARSHIPS WERE DISTRIBUTED TO 3 PRE-DENTAL STUDENTS. THE FOUNDATION OPERATES THE JOHN GEIS, DDS DENTAL CLINIC WHICH PROVIDES FREE FULL-MOUTH RESTORATIONS TO VETERANS RESIDING AT VETERANS VILLAGE SAN DIEGO.</Desc>
